<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping -- Tuticorin cargoes - March 3.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping -- Tuticorin cargoes - March 3.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the berthing schedule of major vessels loading and unloading at India's Tuticorin port on March 3:</p>
<p> Commodity	    Tons/TEUS		   Ship	  Berthing</p>
<p>		   (LDD/ULD) (Balance)</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Salt	     3,135/--- (LDD)   ---/5,380 Biu Ryu Gang    01/03</p>
<p>Coal	    21,041/--- (ULD) 1,611/---   Surya Kiruba    27/02</p>
<p>Rock Phos	  650/--- (ULD) 6,950/---   Kaptin Kissa    02/03</p>
<p>Coal	    24,270/--- (ULD) 1,587/---   Tamil Anna	01/03</p>
<p>Coal	    12,457/--- (ULD)19,126/---   APJ Akhil	 02/03</p>
<p>Dun Peas	   417/--- (ULD)16,783/---   Gomain Naree    02/03</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>		  Note:</p>
<p>	    LDD - Loading</p>
<p>	    ULD - Unloading</p>
<p>(Source: J.M.Baxi &amp; Co, Tuticorin)</p>
